body:
I ran into this same issue.  By simply including the "quarkus-smallrye-openapi" dependency, my REST tests began to fail with the same error message described in this issue.

I can provide a reproducer if necessary.  I tested using Quarkus versions 0.15.0, 0.16.0, 0.16.1, 0.17.0, and 0.18.0 with the same error result described in this issue;

{"error":"This method is normally automatically overridden in subclasses: did you forget to annotate your entity with @Entity?","code":500}

Thanks.
